Third-party components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

AgoraDB depends on the following third-party projects. Their licenses are
checked on every change with `cargo deny check licenses` (see deny.toml).
The complete, exact dependency set is recorded in Cargo.lock.

Apache Arrow (arrow, arrow-array, arrow-schema, arrow-select, arrow-cast, parquet)
  https://arrow.apache.org/  -  Apache License 2.0
  Copyright The Apache Software Foundation

Apache DataFusion (datafusion)
  https://datafusion.apache.org/  -  Apache License 2.0
  Copyright The Apache Software Foundation

Apache Iceberg Rust (iceberg)
  https://rust.iceberg.apache.org/  -  Apache License 2.0
  Copyright The Apache Software Foundation

Apache OpenDAL (opendal)
  https://opendal.apache.org/  -  Apache License 2.0
  Copyright The Apache Software Foundation

datafusion-federation
  https://github.com/datafusion-contrib/datafusion-federation  -  Apache License 2.0

sqlparser-rs (sqlparser)
  https://github.com/apache/datafusion-sqlparser-rs  -  Apache License 2.0
  Copyright The Apache Software Foundation

DuckDB and duckdb-rs (duckdb, libduckdb-sys)
  https://duckdb.org/  -  MIT License
  Copyright 2018-2026 Stichting DuckDB Foundation
  The `bundled` feature compiles the DuckDB C++ sources into the binary.

rusqlite (rusqlite, libsqlite3-sys)
